<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets second repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets second repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered to inject 60 billion escudos of one-day funds into the money market in a second variable rate securities repurchase tender.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be submitted by 1245 GMT.</p>
<p>Funds were previously injected at an average weighted interest rate of 6.0054 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
